Package: frc-spotter
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: The robot's team <nobody@localhost>
Depends: systemd, init-system-helpers, polkitd | policykit-1
Conflicts: frc-coprocessor-agent
Replaces: frc-coprocessor-agent
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: health and checks of an FRC robot's coprocessor, for the robot to poll
 A small web service an FRC robot's coprocessor runs: the computer's health
 (load, heat, memory, disks, the journal, the drive) and the checks its packs
 define, which the robot polls and judges. It bundles its own Java runtime.
 Configure it in /etc/frc-spotter/agent.json.
